        (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/4993">issue 4993</a>)
    - @ref sqlutilintro "SqlUtil" module
      - fixed PostgreSQL table discovery and description support for partitioned tables
    - @ref websockethandlerintro "WebSocketHandler" module
      - removed a debug logging call from the message send path that could cause an infinite loop
    - fixed a crash when destroying uninitialized thread-local storage on Alpine Linux
    - fixed an infinite loop with a memory leak caused by a missing break statement in internal Socket SSL
      error-handling code
      (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/4994">issue 4994</a>)
    - fixed a scanner macro collision that prevented Qore from being compiled with GCC 16
      (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/5391">issue 5391</a>)

