      (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/4983">issue 4983</a>)
    - fixed a descriptor leak in non-blocking Socket connect operations
      (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/4981">issue 4981</a>)
    - fixed a crash when creating a \c LoggerEvent with a missing \c categoryName in the logger_bin module
