    - @ref swaggerintro "Swagger" module
      - fixed support of nullable object properties
        (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/4854">issue 4854</a>)
    - fixed bugs handling base64-URL-encoded strings
      (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/4871">issue 4871</a>)
    - fixed a bug where %Qore would crash if an @ref on_error "on_error statement" referred to the active exception
      when erroneously called after a @ref thread_exit "thread_exit statement"
      (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/4864">issue 4864</a>)
    - fixed a bug where the HTTP connection path would be silently overwritten when processing redirects
      (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/4841">issue 4841</a>)
    - fixed a bug setting the local time zone on macOS Sonoma
      (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/4818">issue 4818</a>)
    - fixed a bug where %Qore could characters with the incorrect character encoding to strings while processing HTTP
      headers in HTTP calls
      (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/4810">issue 4810</a>)

