      (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/3031">issue 3031</a>)

    @section qore_08137 Qore 0.8.13.7

    @par Release Summary
    Bugfix release; see details below

    @subsection qore_08137_bug_fixes Bug Fixes in Qore
    - module fixes:
      - @ref connectionproviderintro "ConnectionProvider":
        - removed unnecessary serialization from AbstractConnection::get()
          (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/2880">issue 2880</a>)
