    @par Release Summary
    Bugfix release; see details below

    @subsection qore_08132_new_features New Features in Qore
    - \c "thread list", \c "backtrace all" commands implemented for the debugger (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/2608">issue 2608</a>)
