    - fixed a crash when @ref Qore::HTTPClient::setDefaultPath() "HTTPClient::setDefaultPath()" was called with no argument (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/2610">issue 2610</a>)
    - fixed a bug in debugger when program is not set (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/2603">issue 2603</a>)

